      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} Is there any other way to see this information? You guys are always like “oh yeah we need to make things less confusing for new users” but this information is critical for instructing new users that they need to, and how to enable, cross-avatar interaction. Without this indicator the result is “oh well I guess the avatar is just broken”.",
