      "restoredAt": null,
      "sourceFeatureExtractionItemID": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5acad9ecc9dba010c9c3ec68|full_name} I have avatar interactions disabled for non-friends. I often do remember that and turn them on when I'm talking to people that don't seem too weird. Other people are often not aware of that and their avatar systems seem to not work without a clear reason.\n\nSometimes they are convinced they have interactions on when they clearly don't.\n\nThis icon saves a lot of confusion since then I can see that the problem is not the avatar, but the interactions being off. It would be great to at least have the icon on an expanded name plate",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
